Package: veryMAD
Title: MAD-Based Quality Control and Robust Scaling
Version: 0.7.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Thomas", "Sirchi", , "thomasirchi@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Annotates numeric metrics with user-specified median absolute
    deviation thresholds and robustly scales numeric vectors, matrices, and
    data frames.
    Users choose the metrics, directions, transformations, and filtering
    decisions.
